# Single build output root, shared by all eight examples:
#   out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\            exes + the STAGED COM servers
#   out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\obj\<Proj>\ intermediates
# Pinned in common\HarnessCom.props. There is one solution for the whole tree --
# as in the sibling _TargetCore_UseExamples* trees -- so the folder fills up eight
# targets at a time; the eight target names are distinct, so they cannot collide.
#
# The staged DLLs (MsgcoreCom, TargetCom, TargetFacade, Msgcore, TargetCore) are
# copies run_all.ps1 makes so that ONE Msgcore.dll is on the search path for both
# servers -- see the header of that script. They are build output like any other.
out/

logs/
.vs/
*.user
